ndia in a state where skill-based gaming is legally permitted",'\n',"\u2022 You are not a resident of Assam, Odisha, Telangana, Andhra Pradesh, Nagaland, Sikkim, or any other state where online gaming for money is prohibited",'\n',"\u2022 You are playing voluntarily and using your own funds",'\n',"\u2022 You have not been previously banned from our platform"]}),(0,f.jsx)(l.Text,{style:{fontSize:13,fontWeight:'800',color:'#0F172A',marginTop:10},children:"3. Nature of Games"}),(0,f.jsx)(l.Text,{style:{fontSize:12,color:'#475569',marginTop:4,lineHeight:17},children:"Dream Ludo is a skill-based gaming platform. Ludo involves elements of strategy, decision-making, and skill. The outcome is not purely based on chance. Real money can be won or lost. This is NOT gambling \u2014 it is a game of skill, recognized under Indian law. However, results are not guaranteed, and you may lose your deposited funds."}),(0,f.jsx)(l.Text,{style:{fontSize:13,fontWeight:'800',color:'#0F172A',marginTop:10},children:"4. Account Registration"}),(0,f.jsxs)(l.Text,{style:{fontSize:12,color:'#475569',marginTop:4,lineHeight:17},children:["\u2022 You must register with a valid Indian mobile number",'\n',"\u2022 One account per person \u2014 multiple accounts are strictly prohibited",'\n',"\u2022 You are responsible for maintaining the security of your account",'\n',"\u2022 Provide accurate and truthful information during registration"]}),(0,f.jsx)(l.Text,{style:{fontSize:13,fontWeight:'800',color:'#0F172A',marginTop:10},children:"5. Deposits and Withdrawals"}),(0,f.jsxs)(l.Text,{style:{fontSize:12,color:'#475569',marginTop:4,lineHeight:17},children:["\u2022 Minimum deposit: \u20b910 | Minimum withdrawal: \u20b9100",'\n',"\u2022 Deposits are made via PhonePe/UPI payment gateway",'\n',"\u2022 Withdrawals are processed to your registered UPI ID or bank account",'\n',"\u2022 Only \"Winning Balance\" and \"Deposit Balance\" are withdrawable \u2014 \"Bonus Balance\" cannot be directly withdrawn",'\n',"\u2022 Withdrawals are subject to TDS (Tax Deducted at Source) @ 30% as per Section 194BA of the Income Tax Act, 1961",'\n',"\u2022 Withdrawal processing time: 10\u201360 minutes during business hours",'\n',"\u2022 We reserve the right to hold withdrawals for fraud verification"]}),(0,f.jsx)(l.Text,{style:{fontSize:13,fontWeight:'800',color:'#0F172A',marginTop:10},children:"6. Tax Deducted at Source (TDS)"}),(0,f.jsxs)(l.Text,{style:{fontSize:12,color:'#475569',marginTop:4,lineHeight:17},children:["As per the Income Tax Act (Section 194BA, effective April 1, 2023), 30% TDS is deducted on net winnings from online gaming at the time of each withdrawal.",'\n',"\u2022 TDS @ 30% is automatically deducted from every withdrawal",'\n',"\u2022 Example: If you withdraw \u20b91,000, TDS of \u20b9300 is deducted, and \u20b9700 is credited to your account",'\n',"\u2022 TDS certificates (Form 16A) will be available upon request",'\n',"\u2022 Users are responsible for filing their own income tax returns"]}),(0,f.jsx)(l.Text,{style:{fontSize:13,fontWeight:'800',color:'#0F172A',marginTop:10},children:"7. Fair Play and Prohibited Conduct"}),(0,f.jsxs)(l.Text,{style:{fontSize:12,color:'#475569',marginTop:4,lineHeight:17},children:["The following are strictly prohibited:",'\n',"\u2022 Using bots, scripts, or automated tools",'\n',"\u2022 Collusion with other players",'\n',"\u2022 Creating multiple accounts",'\n',"\u2022 Exploiting bugs or glitches",'\n',"\u2022 Fraudulent payment activity",'\n',"\u2022 Any form of cheating or unfair play",'\n',"Violation of these rules will result in immediate account suspension and forfeiture of all balances."]}),(0,f.jsx)(l.Text,{style:{fontSize:13,fontWeight:'800',color:'#0F172A',marginTop:10},children:"8. Responsible Gaming"}),(0,f.jsx)(l.Text,{style:{fontSize:12,color:'#475569',marginTop:4,lineHeight:17},children:"We are committed to responsible gaming. You can set deposit limits, loss limits, and self-exclusion periods from the Responsible Gaming s